flowchart LR
    ArcadeEntry[Slop arcade entrypoint] --> ArcadeConfig[Arcade runtime config]
    ArcadeEntry --> Adapter[Thin Modoki hub adapter]
    Adapter --> Hub[Registry-driven hub router and lifecycle]

    StandaloneEntry[Junkyard standalone entrypoint] --> StandaloneConfig[Junkyard runtime config]
    StandaloneEntry --> StandaloneAdapter[Thin Junkyard adapter]
    StandaloneAdapter --> GameShell[Shared return navigation]
    StandaloneAdapter --> JunkyardPresentation

    Hub --> IslandPresentation[Personal Island presentation]
    Hub --> ParkingPresentation[Parking Jam presentation]
    Hub --> JunkyardPresentation[Junkyard Station presentation]

    IslandPresentation --> IslandApplication[Island session application]
    IslandPresentation --> IslandStorage[Local island repository]
    IslandPresentation --> IslandDomain[Deterministic island domain]
    IslandPresentation --> PlayerInput[Shared keyboard and touch movement]
    IslandApplication --> IslandDomain
    IslandStorage --> IslandDomain

    ParkingPresentation --> ParkingRules[Parking command facade]
    ParkingRules --> ParkingBoard[Board occupancy and path rules]
    ParkingRules --> ParkingQueue[Passenger queue and scoring]
    ParkingQueue --> ParkingEvents[Semantic event factory]
    ParkingSolver[Deterministic solver] --> ParkingRules

    JunkyardPresentation --> JunkyardDomain[Junkyard pure domain]
    JunkyardPresentation --> PlayerInput
    JunkyardDomain --> ProximityDomain[Shared proximity-world domain]

    Quality[Quality contract] --> Tooling[Architecture, code, asset and browser gates]
    Tooling --> Coverage[All game TypeScript has one architecture owner]
    Tooling --> WorkflowBoundary[Workflows cannot mutate source branches]
